 [IO.File]::WriteAllText("$out/run.cmd","@echo off`ncall `"$vs/VC/Auxiliary/Build/vcvars64.bat`" >nul`ncd /d `"$out`"`ncl /nologo /EHsc /std:c++17 /W4 $asan /I`"$out`" `"$PSScriptRoot/AlunethChestRetryTest.cpp`" /Fe:test.exe /Fo:test.obj`nif errorlevel 1 exit /b 1`ntest.exe original-events.tsv original-conditions.tsv fixed-events.tsv fixed-conditions.tsv`nexit /b %errorlevel%`n")
 & "$out/run.cmd";if($LASTEXITCODE){throw 'Native initial-chest phased retry regression failed'}
 'PASS ten TEMP tables/twice/full preservation and ten old/applied custom refusals; native loaded shapes exercise actual SmartAI timers/phase/Reset/LINK/conditions/near-GO. No live character mutation or automatic progression.'
